<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TransTechnology rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TransTechnology rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Chicago Corp said Wednesday it began coverage of TransTechnology Corp with a buy recommendation and a $32 a share 12-month price target.</p>
<p>-- TransTechnology shares were up 1/4 at 21-1/4.</p>
<p>-- TransTechnology makes specialty engineered fastener products and highly engineered rescue hoists and cargo hooks.</p>
<p>-- ABN AMRO said it estimates fiscal 1998 earnings at $2.15 a share, up from $1.92 a year ago, and fiscal 1999 earnings at $2.50. It estimates long-term earnings per share growth at 15 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
